      "q": "How much does Bell Textron make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Bell Textron has $2.1B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Bell Textron has received 891 awards so far this fiscal year, the average award size is $2.3M, and obligations are up 36.8% year over year."
