    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Bell Textron?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense is the top buyer from Bell Textron with $2B in obligations in FY2026 to date. Other federal buyers include the Department of the Interior with $53.2M, the Department of Justice with $717K, the Department of Transportation with $135K, and the Department of Energy with $58.5K."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Bell Textron sell to the government?",
